\"},\"evidence_delivery\":\"Registered full reads are logged tool reads; Evidence headers show selected ranges, whose delivery requires HTTP confirmation.\",\"required_mechanisms_exposed\":{\"deepinfer/engine/stats_logger.py\":{\"exposed\":4,\"registered\":4},\"deepinfer/environ.py\":{\"exposed\":3,\"registered\":3},\"deepinfer/logger.py\":{\"exposed\":3,\"registered\":3}}}"}], "tool_calls": null, "raw": null, "token_usage": null}, {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "\n\n```python\nenv = read_file(\"deepinfer/environ.py\")\nprint(env[\"file_hash\"][:8])\nlg = read_range(\"deepinfer/logger.py\", 100, 200)\nprint(lg[\"content\"])\n```\n</｜｜DSML｜｜output>```"}], "tool_calls": null, "raw": null, "token_usage": null}, {"role": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Latest execution feedback:\nExecutor output:\nExecution logs:\nfe2c5319\n[versioned evidence retained separately]\nLast output from code snippet:\nNone\nRecent project tool results:\n[{\"tool\":\"read_range\",\"arguments\":{\"start_line\":1,\"end_line\":110},\"result\":{\"path\":\"deepinfer/logger.py\",\"file_hash\":\"5b8f8d9947de692353609c1fc2851097d24f9b6ba6004dce1dbfa394dc6d3ec8\"}},{\"tool\":\"run_command\",\"arguments\":{\"argv\":[\"python\",\"-m\",\"pytest\",\"-q\"]},\"result\":{\"rc\":1,\"stderr\":\"\",\"timed_out\":false,\"stdout\":\"est_invalid_budget[64] - TypeError: NewLineFo...\\nFAILED .course/test_logger.py::test_invalid_budget[value7] - TypeError: \\n[full record remains in run.log]\\nent\\nFAILED .course/test_logging_config.py::test_real_default_handler_and_statistics_queue\\n50 failed, 10 passed in 3.65s\\n\"}},{\"tool\":\"read_file\",\"arguments\":{},\"result\":{\"path\":\"deepinfer/environ.py\",\"file_hash\":\"fe2c531989c419f0b51b169a07f5ed826dcec7f95c0c5bc3a351805923c4f218\"}},{\"tool\":\"read_range\",\"arguments\":{\"start_line\":100,\"end_line\":200},\"result\":{\"path\":\"deepinfer/logger.py\",\"file_hash\":\"5b8f8d9947de692353609c1fc2851097d24f9b6ba6004dce1